{"sections":[{"id":144,"title":"Featured","section_type":"featured","data":[{"id":42864,"title":"صقر و كناريا","description":"Saqr falls in love with fashion designer Kanarya, but their love story becomes complicated due to complex family issues involving her sister and brother-in-law.","card_type":"featured","type":"MOVIE","style":{"image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/84c173e4-d12b-4854-93ac-a74654b4fefd.jpg","logo":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/5ff735d0-b6b7-4b8b-b204-0009ce7bf49d.png","background_image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/a07ded2c-5efc-4d40-a404-cf6619465bda.png"}},{"id":42779,"title":"Matchbox the Movie","description":"When a group of former childhood friends reconnect, their reunion takes a wild turn as they stumble upon a dangerous international plot—and must save the world.","card_type":"featured","type":"MOVIE","style":{"image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/a2b136d2-9098-4bf6-96d3-cb52c1b2d892.jpg","logo":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/af40fc29-c9c4-4721-86dc-5235905cf7c8.JPG","background_image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/794697ab-a1bd-46f6-88a2-9afa53998794.jpg"}},{"id":42050,"title":"Spider-Man: Brand New Day","description":"Fighting crime full-time as Spider-Man in a world that doesn't remember him—and the pressure of seeing his old friends move on without him—sparks a change in Peter Parker he may not have the power to control. But that transformation might also be the only thing that can stop a shocking new threat to the city and those he loves - a powerful villain no one can even see.","card_type":"featured","type":"MOVIE","style":{"image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/a35243b2-2758-4e5a-b871-068b02d8cf97.JPG","logo":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/83cd4ae0-a2a9-4f9b-ba38-6a44ef48ffd0.JPG","background_image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/873c0a95-305a-496a-8d23-443e57a3181b.JPG"}},{"id":42841,"title":"Buddy","description":"وحيد القرن البرتقالي الساحر والمغني يحتجز طاقمه كرهينة في بُعد سريالي لبرنامج تلفزيوني، بينما يصبح مجنونًا أكثر فأكثر.","card_type":"featured","type":"MOVIE","style":{"image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/3ab9802d-6bf7-4941-8094-d236744be52e.jpg","logo":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/f706204c-1d1e-41cd-a1c7-c53ac9b5a168.jpg","background_image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/51fa0c78-c7e3-431c-baeb-2ac1d9e9cdf2.jpg"}},{"id":42760,"title":"Insidious: Out of the Further","description":"Gemma, a young mother raising her daughter in the house she grew up in, discovers she can travel into The Further, where she possesses an ability to bring what lives there back to the real world.","card_type":"featured","type":"MOVIE","style":{"image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/0dd15f1a-bcad-459c-953c-cb78a4de9ae7.jpg","logo":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/cf7abc6f-5fe3-41e2-b52e-b6cee9296e11.png","background_image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/484ac088-937f-4e59-b800-45669ed4b961.jpg"}},{"id":42759,"title":"Fall 2: Deadpoint","description":"On a perilous climb across Thailand's Mount Kwan, two climbers become trapped thousands of feet above the ground, where vertigo-inducing heights, sheer exposure, and impossible odds turn every moment into a fight for survival.","card_type":"featured","type":"MOVIE","style":{"image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/da676ab1-6f45-4d09-a5e6-24a0e488501f.JPG","logo":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/9ce663b8-e9cf-4737-be7a-a4d0155c48fa.JPG","background_image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/436cf748-d104-4975-8caf-0758d2fce641.JPG"}},{"id":42657,"title":"Awarapan 2","description":"Shivam returns to the crime world, where his path forward demands redemption, love, and sacrifice. As relationships deepen and conflicts intensify, every choice tests his resolve and shapes his destiny.","card_type":"featured","type":"MOVIE","style":{"image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/93c0e070-722e-43eb-b964-2040c19ba80a.jpg","logo":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/5be7919e-c9fd-4e69-8068-32e3f0e6bb35.JPG","background_image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/85fb75e0-00bf-4935-9bae-ad3269535273.jpg"}},{"id":42688,"title":"The Uprising","description":"As war and plague devastate 14th-century England, a humble peasant ignites a rebellion, uniting an army of commoners to defy the King’s might in a desperate fight for justice and survival.","card_type":"featured","type":"MOVIE","style":{"image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/30912607-001b-4870-8c5f-f67e1dc5cf34.jpg","logo":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/ed79c260-6bb9-4f26-a684-c15764c16399.png","background_image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/ae2754b0-9327-4e56-a7fb-60ca6ac5fdc4.jpg"}},{"id":42693,"title":"Detective Conan: The Counterfeit Case of Ultra 30","description":"As a new 10,000-yen banknote featuring the Touto Tower design is issued and the nation is swept up in excitement, Conan and the Junior Detective League, accompanied by Professor Agasa, Ran, and Sonoko, visit the Nagano factory of the Japan Banknote Printing Bureau. Meanwhile, counterfeit money is discovered at the scene of a murder in Tokyo, prompting the Metropolitan Police Department to establish an investigation headquarters. As the unprecedented circulation of counterfeit new banknotes throws the public into confusion, Conan and Heiji head to Osaka, where the counterfeit money is believed to have been printed.","card_type":"featured","type":"MOVIE","style":{"image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/36676ada-acf3-45d1-8d9b-e0f2727eaa6a.jpg","logo":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/6f874725-58d9-4252-aff6-95b1cf0b92dd.png","background_image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/d2b3c69b-2688-42a4-9323-b9a8eec39466.jpg"}},{"id":42391,"title":"Mayday","description":"When a U.S. Navy pilot on a top-secret mission during the Cold War gets trapped behind enemy lines, his only chance at survival is to form an alliance with an eccentric ex-KGB agent.","card_type":"featured","type":"MOVIE","style":{"image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/a3604613-bb79-4027-8770-1192a0186d29.jpg","logo":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/a3217a