c7a99e23e8.jpg"},{"image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk44/shows/8c68dfea-f8c6-4f38-ac82-6262fcf1a11f.jpg"},{"image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk45/shows/05b24670-16cc-4eff-a2bb-eb66ec434062.jpg"},{"image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk51/shows/0be6ac28-46d6-494b-a531-ec1b3ff9d509.jpg"}],"continue_watching_progress":0}],"linker":{"type":"COLLECTIONS","id":0}},{"id":238,"title":"Weekly Trending","section_type":"trendingMovingCollection","data":[{"id":39680,"title":"Yeraltı - تحت الارض","description":"Haydar Ali after avenging his family’s murder, ends up in prison. There, he finds himself in the middle of one of Türkiye’s most dangerous underground cartels. However, the truly deadly confrontation begins three years later, when he regains his freedom and learns that the woman whom he has never been able to forget, is now the wife of the man closest to him.","card_type":"trendingMovingCollection","type":"SERIES","style":{"image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/38fe3d55-1b6d-450d-8a89-3d8fc91ebdbe.jpg","background_color":"#890b0b"}},{"id":34867,"title":"Distant City - المدينة البعيدة","description":"Alya Albora arrives in the Albora lands of Mardin from Canada with her late husband’s body and her five-year-old son, fulfilling his final wish. However, there is no return or escape from Albora. Cihan Albora, the head of the Albora family, may not remain indifferent to Alya’s struggles, but he refuses to let her leave with her child. As Alya faces the dark past, hidden secrets, and the realities of the region, she finds herself in a fierce battle with her husband’s family.","card_type":"trendingMovingCollection","type":"SERIES","style":{"image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/36056e1c-7768-4de8-abf5-32578ad8fe04.png","background_color":"#4c0404"}},{"id":38370,"title":"taşacak Bu deniz - هذا البحر سوف يفيض","description":"In a land where people are accustomed to battling fierce waves and constant storms, the story of a woman who stands tall on her feet, with all her emotional strength, resilience and endurance, and a man who is passionate about his \"love\" and who competes with the storms of the Black Sea and struggles with its waves, comes to the screens with an effective script... The ups and downs of the mountains, the sea and the human soul are told through the eyes of a stranger who finds himself in the middle of the endless war between two mortal enemies...","card_type":"trendingMovingCollection","type":"SERIES","style":{"image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/acf0e220-f7be-457b-b4ea-120bbb323eee.jpg","background_color":""}},{"id":38366,"title":"guller ve gunahlar - ورود وذنوب ","description":"As a boy, Serhat lost both his father and fortune but built an empire on family and integrity. His world shatters when his wife Berrak hides a devastating secret and falls into a coma. While searching for answers, his heart hardens — until he meets Zeynep, a passionate florist chasing the same truth, igniting a journey of trust, passion, and redemption.","card_type":"trendingMovingCollection","type":"SERIES","style":{"image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/cdfb6171-a614-478d-bd7e-089a3316d1ba.jpg","background_color":""}},{"id":42864,"title":"صقر و كناريا","description":"Saqr falls in love with fashion designer Kanarya, but their love story becomes complicated due to complex family issues involving her sister and brother-in-law.","card_type":"trendingMovingCollection","type":"MOVIE","style":{"image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/a07ded2c-5efc-4d40-a404-cf6619465bda.png","background_color":""}},{"id":42732,"title":"احلى نصيب","description":"A temporary husband. And a predicament that seems permanent. As Rakan and Noura try to keep their charade one step ahead of the gossip and rumors, the arrangement that seemed ideal takes an increasingly unexpected turn away from the script.","card_type":"trendingMovingCollection","type":"SERIES","style":{"image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/8fce81f6-5d76-4372-b4b1-bd2de1c4165e.jpg","background_color":""}},{"id":35429,"title":"المدينة البعيدة مدبلج","description":"صل امرأة إلى موطن زوجها الراحل مع ابنها لدفن جثمانه والمغادرة بسلام، إلا أن عائلته ذات النفوذ القوية تمنعها من المغادرة وتحدث معارك تُظهر الكثير من الأسرار المظلمة.","card_type":"trendingMovingCollection","type":"SERIES","style":{"image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/5e1b8ca2-3c46-42ed-bd28-68b32829f881.jpg","background_color":"#6a4e37"}},{"id":39883,"title":"Sevdigim sensin - أنت من أحب","description":"Erkan Aldur, a young man from a wealthy Istanbul family, is stationed in eastern Turkey to complete his mandatory military service in a remote, earthquake-stricken region. In this harsh and unfamiliar landscape, he meets Dicle, a young woman who has lived her entire life in the village and whose world is shaped by tradition, family, and community. Their encounter brings together two very different worlds, setting in motion a journey of change, resilience, and unexpected connection. As Dicle steps into the unfamiliar and Erkan faces new responsibilities, their story unfolds into a heartfelt and transformative tale of love and courage, that bridges even the widest divides","card_type":"trendingMovingCollection","type":"SERIES","style":{"image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/e892048c-7244-4c62-905c-0fe31450d887.jpg","background_color":"#7a0505"}},{"id":41162,"title":"Daha 17 - في السابعة عشر","description":"The story begins with Aras, a 17-year-old, who goes to Bodrum to search for his sister.","card_type":"trendingMovingCollection","type":"SERIES","style":{"image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/7137969e-13b7-4dcd-871e-71838ad182c8.jpg","background_color":"#c10101"}},{"id":40410,"title":"انت من احببت مدبلج","description":"Sevdiğim Sensin tells the story of Dicle, a village girl whom Istanbul native Erkan saves from his cruel brothers by marrying her during his military service, and their journey that extends to Istanbul. Believing in this marriage with her pure heart, Dicle steps into Istanbul’s glittering yet harsh world, unaware of the planned marriage Erkan’s family wants for him.","card_type":"trendingMovingCollection","type":"SERIES","style":{"image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/554a89ca-a997-4593-96cf-e102dee3a611.jpg","background_color":""}},{"id":41388,"title":"Altı Üstü İstanbul - اسطنبول راسا على عقب","description":"\"Altı Üstü İstanbul\" centers on the struggle for survival of Emir (Rahimcan Kapkap) and his friends, who live in a working-class neighborhood on the outskirts of Istanbul.\r\n\r\nAs they chase their dreams, the young people are confronted with power, money, and betrayal. With every step they take, they are forced to make decisions that will change not only their own lives but also each other's destinies.\r\n\r\nIn a story where friendships are broken, love is reshaped, and everyone fights their own battle, viewers are taken on an emotional and gripping journey through the complex streets of Istanbul.","card_type":"trendingMovingCollection","type":"SERIES","style":{"image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/7d23120c-3696-4a87-b23c-e5b26ef12e51.jpg","background_color":"#b28068"}},{"id":39389,"title":"ورود وذنوب  مدبلج","description":"عندما كان صبيا ، فقد سرحات والده وثروته لكنه بنى إمبراطورية على الأسرة والنزاهة. يتحطم عالمه عندما تخفي زوجته بيراك سرا مدمرا وتسقط في غيبوبة. أثناء البحث عن إجابات ، يتصلب قلبه - حتى يلتقي بزينب ، بائع الزهور الشغوف الذي يطارد نفس الحقيقة ، ويشعل رحلة من الثقة والعاطفة والفداء.","card_type":"trendingMovingCollection","type":"SERIES","style":{"image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/700b6da6-e2c0-49f9-98ae-adad0a17fc88.jpg","background_color":""}}],"linker":{"type":"SECTIONS","id":238},"style":{"background_color":"#dc3c28","image":"","logo":""},"description":"Yeraltı - تحت الارض, Distant City - المدينة البعيدة, taşacak Bu deniz - هذا البحر سوف يفيض, guller ve gunahlar - ورود وذنوب , صقر و كناريا, احلى نصيب, المدينة البعيدة مدبلج, Sevdigim sensin - أنت من أحب, Daha 17 - في السابعة عشر, انت من احبب